OL,3,GNEWSAMuseum's last day before two-year
OL,4,Aclosure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA museum is preparing for its last
OL,7,Fvisitors before closing for a #13.6m
OL,8,Frefurbishment scheduled to take two
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FThe Sunderland Museum and Winter
OL,12,FGardens, which opened at its current
OL,13,Flocation off Burdon Road in 1879, will
OL,14,Fshut on Saturday afternoon for repairs,
OL,15,Fthe relocation of the main entrance,
OL,16,Fchanges to the layout and the addition
OL,17,Fof two new galleries.
OL,19,FHowever Sea Change, the operator of the
OL,20,Fmuseum's cafe that is staffed by people
OL,21,Fwith autism and learning disabilities,
OL,22,Fwill permanently close.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
