OL,3,GNEWSAMuseum's last day before two-year
OL,4,Aclosure
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrina Murphy, manager of museum
OL,7,Fredevelopment at Sunderland City
OL,8,FCouncil, said many visitors were coming
OL,9,Fto say goodbye to its most famous
OL,10,Fattraction, the 164-year-old Wallace
OL,11,Fthe lion.
